  "projectSettings.ai.completionBatchSizeDescription": "Ni seli ngapi ambazo hazijatafsiriwa kifurushi kimoja cha \"Endesha ukamilishaji wa AI\" huandaa rasimu zake (1–50). Endesha tena ili kuendelea mbele. Chaguo-msingi: {defaultSize}.",
